    <innerclass refid="structterminal_1_1_image_sequence" prot="public">terminal::ImageSequence</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespaceterminal">terminal</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Platform-native image decoding and BGRA-to-RGBA conversion. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Shared by KittyDecoder and ITerm2Decoder. The native decode function is implemented in platform-specific translation units:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="_image_decode_mac_8mm" kindref="compound">ImageDecodeMac.mm</ref> (macOS / iOS — CoreGraphics + ImageIO)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="_image_decode_win_8cpp" kindref="compound">ImageDecodeWin.cpp</ref> (Windows — WIC)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>KittyDecoder </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>ITerm2Decoder </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
